Dear Hiring Manager,

Recently relocated to Niagara Falls NY and currently seeking new work opportunities. I am confident that my various employment skills to include customer support, training/education support, helpdesk support (remote and onsite), client support services, and exceptional attention to detail; coupled with my passion for providing an excellent customer service and educator experience, makes me a perfect match for a position within your company. I have always held myself to high standards and in my current position, I continue to do so.  I take pride in being a life-long learner who would bring to the position a broad amount of experience to include: 

Abundant customer service and client satisfaction support;

Research and computer skills: various software ( MAC OS, MS Office, and Google Suites);

Leadership: supervising, educating, training, instructing, and issue resolution, small business owner;

Exceptional time management, detail oriented and organization skills; 

Education/Teaching: Paraprofessional for Cobb County School District, After school Assistant Instructor, GED Instructor,  Adult Educator, DUI Risk Reduction Instructor, Residential Recovery Case Manager Paraprofessional, SAT Tutor, Math and Reading Literacy 2nd grade Supply Teacher.

Works well independently, but excels as a team player who is extremely flexible. 

I have excellent people and communication skills (both verbal and written) making it possible for me to communicate performance goals and needs in a professional, tactful, and effective manner.  Please find attached, a copy of my resume for your review.  I would welcome the opportunity to further discuss this position with you. 


Sincerely,  

Deborah D. Golden, M.A.ED, PPCM
